    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d566">

                <pb facs="0750" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">751.8215/178</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hood</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-19"><hi rendition="#italic">April 19,
                        1922</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received May 23.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 51</seg>
                    <lb/>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Diplomatic</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Legation has the honor to herewith
                    transmit for the information of the Department a Copy of a Memorandum received
                    from the Secretary of State of the Liberian Government, when approached relative
                    to the appointment of a Liberian representative to join with a French
                    commissioner in the delimitation of the Franco-Liberian frontier.</p>
                <p>The Commissioner Mr. L. C. Daves has found so many discrepancies in the names and
                    positions, as heretofore agreed upon as <pb facs="0751" n="637" xml:id="pg637"/>
                    bases from which calculations were made, it will not be possible to proceed with
                    delimitation until correct data can be had, and this will not be available until
                    the Boundary Commissioner has completed his work.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Solomon Porter
                    Hood</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d566-a1.xml" xpointer="d566-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
